# If OpenAL Soft is configured with libdl support, it doesn't actually need the ALSA, JACK, OpenSL, PipeWire, PortAudio or PulseAudio libraries at build time.
# Only the header files are actually used.
# So this patch makes it so that OpenAL Soft won't be linked against those libraries if configured with libdl support.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ endif
